erview_skills_Screenshot_01_2560X1440.png", "id": "307703721692608", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982516_307703725025941_2021162934857628277_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xIW9cQhdPXcQ7kNvwHY24PG&_nc_oc=AdpQ0hqvhilmFGnRwF0Jas4upIRG3IWCeDT0fgRXwxOtNsLxNhemUTmAK0Di_slBDLk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOICETe_KfsqTIOIzw4-9tAN1Q6oTaDlDdQRK1qLp_5oA&oe=6AD38E83"}, "display_name": "VR Interview Skills", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Our Virtual Reality Interview Skills training package is designed to help candidates seeking employment significantly elevate their interview skills. This immersive VR training provides a hands-on experience for mastering interview techniques while building self confidence in the process. Participants can explore the VR environment at their own pace and engage in one-on-one conversations or formal panel interviews. \nA comprehensive pre-interview checklist initiates the process, guiding participants through crucial preparation steps. This tool prepares candidates for real-life job interviews. Real-time feedback and auditory cues foster a continuous learning environment, and the ability to revisit the VR interview simulation reinforces the learning process.\n\nKey Features and Learning Objectives:\n\u2022Two Interview Styles: Practice both informal interviews with one person and formal interview scenarios with two people.\n\u2022Realistic Interactions: The simulation incorporates a realistic question-and-answer flow that emulates real-world interviews. \n\u2022Expertly Crafted Content: Material researched and designed by subject matter experts.\n\u2022Embedded Learning Objectives: Ensures participants can recall, understand, and apply the necessary skills for successful real-life interviews. \n\u2022Seamless Navigation: Hand-tracking and voice-to-text are the primary navigation methods.", "short_description": "Our Virtual Reality Interview Skills train